  "title": "Pumpkin Pie without Evaporated Milk",
  "description": "For this delicious pumpkin pie, whole milk is stirred into pumpkin purée, so it's a bit lighter than others but still just as delicious and creamy.",
  "authors": [
    "deb dennis"
  ],
